 /* [context-focus]: focused only by a right click, for the context menu. */
-#urlbar:not([open], [popover-open], [usertyping], [searchmode], [opz-keepopen]):is(:not([focused]), [context-focus]) {
+#urlbar:not([open], [popover-open], [usertyping][focused], [searchmode], [opz-keepopen]):is(:not([focused]), [context-focus]) {
   flex: 0 1 auto;
   margin-inline: auto;
 
@@ -1721,7 +1721,7 @@ toolbar[inactive="true"] .urlbar,
  * card, with its results under it, over a dimmed window. Clicks on the dimmed
